{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>את השבת</b> — four. Three in this matter and one in Ezra, לחלל את השבת. And that is as stated in the first chapter of Sanhedrin: it would have been fitting for the Torah to be given through Ezra, but Moses preceded him — for we derive את השבת there from here."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:49.591739385Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}